{"task_id": "6a8d4ce75edde7d4", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "The recurrence has characteristic roots 1 and −9, so a_n = −7(4+(−9)^n)/5. Thus a_102 = −7(4+9^102)/5.\n\nComputing 9^102 mod 1000003 by repeated squaring gives 52785. Then a_102 ≡ −7·52789·5^{-1} ≡ −369523·600002 ≡ 126096 (mod 1000003).\n\n{\"answer\": \"126096\"}", "parsed_answer": "126096", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 27244, "usage": {"input": 262, "output": 1952, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 0, "totalTokens": 2214, "cost": {"input": 3.93e-05, "output": 0.000976, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0010153}}, "cost_usd": 0.0010153, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "f94a8af8-8224-415e-b984-7162e54ab010"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T15:41:05+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T15:41:32+00:00"}
