{"task_id": "a50a4ca18549a487", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "I'll evaluate this step by step.\n\n**First bracket:** (3181+1471) = 4652; 4652² = 21,641,104; cubed: 21,641,104³ = 10,135,337,998,282,080,292,864.\n\n**Second bracket:**\n- (4008·24)² = 96192² = 9,252,900,864\n- (2006 + 11! − 786) = 39,918,020; (3137 + 5403·3890) = 21,020,807; product = 839,108,994,242,140\n- minus (3302·7263 + 1847) = 23,984,273, minus 1994·5040 = 10,049,760 → 839,108,960,208,107\n- (8232 − 40320·12831) + 6274 = −517,331,414; (1474·5838)·25277 = 8,605,212·25,277 = 217,513,943,724; difference = −218,031,275,138\n- So: 9,252,900,864 − 839,108,960,208,107 − (−218,031,275,138) = −838,881,676,032,105\n\nSum with first bracket: 10,135,337,998,282,080,292,864 − 838,881,676,032,105 = 10,135,337,159,400,404,260,759.\n\n**Third bracket:**\n- 8507·7037 = 59,863,759; (5307+3366+5040) = 13,713; 13,713² = 188,046,369\n- 6977 − (59,863,759 − 188,046,369) = 6977 + 128,182,610 = 128,189,587\n- (10!·3439)·7919 = 12,479,443,200·7919 = 98,824,710,700,800\n- Product: 128,189,587 × 98,824,710,700,800 = 12,668,298,850,130,032,569,600\n\nSubtracting: 10,135,337,159,400,404,260,759 − 12,668,298,850,130,032,569,600 = −2,532,961,690,729,628,308,841.\n\n**Fourth bracket:**\n- (6659)(15992) = 106,490,728; (8253·5358) = 44,219,574\n- 106,490,728 × 44,219,574 = 4,708,974,627,109,872; minus 5809 → 4,708,974,627,104,063\n\n**Final product:**\n−2,532,961,690,729,628,308,841 × 4,708,974,627,104,063\n= −11,927,652,333,072,428,415,895,586,088,009,920,983\n\n{\"answer\": \"-11927652333072428415895586088009920983\"}", "parsed_answer": "-11927652333072428415895586088009920983", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 118314, "usage": {"input": 463, "output": 11533, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 10636, "totalTokens": 11996, "cost": {"input": 6.945e-05, "output": 0.0057665, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00583595}}, "cost_usd": 0.00583595, "attem