{"task_id": "b9ab1408977eca9b", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "## Solution\n\nUsing the product rule with f = ∏(aᵢx + bᵢ), at x = 4:\n\nf(4) = 51·(−7)·23·(−33)·18·26·39·33·32 = 5,222,571,209,856\n\nWith S = f'/f and f'' = f(S′ + S²), S′ = −Σ aᵢ²/(aᵢx+bᵢ)²:\n\n- S = 10/51 + 4/7 + 7/23 + 1/3 + 1/6 + 7/26 + 11/39 + 1/3 + 5/16 = 5,867,683/1,707,888\n- T = 100/2601 + 16/49 + 49/529 + 121/1089 + 9/324 + 49/676 + 121/1521 + 121/1089 + 100/1024 = 337,871,769,665,441/352,942,651,885,824\n\nThen S² − T = 34,429,703,788,489²/... reduced:\n\nS² − T = 361,223,227/33,303,816\n\nSo f''(4) = f(4)·(S² − T) = 5,222,571,209,856 × 361,223,227/33,303,816.\n\nSince 5,222,571,209,856 = 2⁷·3⁶·7·11²·13²·17·23 and 33,303,816 = 2³·3²·7·13²·17·23, the quotient is 16·81·121 = 156,816, giving:\n\nf''(4) = 156,816 × 361,223,227 = 56,645,581,565,232\n\n{\"answer\": \"56645581565232\"}", "parsed_answer": "56645581565232", "correct": false, "parse_status": "wrong", "error": null, "latency_ms": 165788, "usage": {"input": 300, "output": 18911, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 18422, "totalTokens": 19211, "cost": {"input": 4.4999999999999996e-05, "output": 0.0094555, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0095005}}, "cost_usd": 0.0095005, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "chatcmpl-v6xmSSl1nhpdc3YduUyXhLXjNTEh3"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T15:41:23+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T15:44:09+00:00"}
