{"task_id": "9d7f52df50ce2194", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "**Reasoning:** The leading coefficient of a product of linear factors is the product of the leading coefficients of each factor.\n\nMultiplying all 36 leading coefficients:\n\n(-38)(49)(-35)(15)(-15)(5)(-21)(16)(-18)(-49)(-9)(25)(46)(-38)(10)(-20)(-25)(-44)(-8)(10)(3)(-26)(-38)(-34)(-34)(-30)(-4)(-43)(21)(-3)(-19)(1)(-50)(6)(-49)(43)\n\nThe count of negative factors is 24 (even), so the result is positive... checking sign carefully: negatives appear at factors 1,3,5,7,9,10,11,14,16,17,18,19,23,24,25,27,28,30,31,33,35 — 21 negatives total, so result is negative.\n\nMultiplying step by step gives:\n\n-46,797,182,750,601,523,306,377,871,257,600,000,000,000 × 43 = -2,012,278,858,275,865,502,174,248,464,076,800,000,000,000\n\n{\"answer\": \"-2012278858275865502174248464076800000000000000\"}", "parsed_answer": "-2012278858275865502174248464076800000000000000", "correct": false, "parse_status": "wrong", "error": null, "latency_ms": 19194, "usage": {"input": 454, "output": 1306, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 0, "totalTokens": 1760, "cost": {"input": 6.81e-05, "output": 0.0006529999999999999, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0007210999999999999}}, "cost_usd": 0.0007210999999999999, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "73b385b0-0598-48c3-bb13-a0a999f9b0ad"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T15:50:24+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T15:50:43+00:00"}
